## 🎯 Common Space Complexity Examples

### Example 5: O(1) Space - No Extra Memory
```cpp
int findMax(int arr[], int n) {
    int max = arr[0];        // 1 variable
    for(int i = 1; i < n; i++) {
        if(arr[i] > max) max = arr[i];
    }
    return max;
}
```
**Space**: `O(1)` - Only `max` and `i` (constant)

---

### Example 6: O(N) Space - Creating New Array
```cpp
int* reverseArray(int arr[], int n) {
    int* reversed = new int[n];    // New array - O(N)
    for(int i = 0; i < n; i++) {
        reversed[i] = arr[n-1-i];
    }
    return reversed;
}
```
**Space**: 
- Input: `arr` (O(N))
- Auxiliary: `reversed` (O(N))
- **Total: O(N)**

---

### Example 7: O(N²) Space - 2D Matrix
```cpp
int** createMatrix(int n) {
    int** matrix = new int*[n];     // N rows
    for(int i = 0; i < n; i++) {
        matrix[i] = new int[n];     // N columns each
    }
    return matrix;
}
```
**Space**: `N × N = O(N²)`

