## 📌 Final Cheat Sheet

| Complexity | Meaning | Memory Usage |
|------------|---------|--------------|
| **O(1)** | Constant | Fixed memory, independent of input |
| **O(N)** | Linear | Memory grows linearly with input |
| **O(N²)** | Quadratic | Memory grows as square of input |
| **O(log N)** | Logarithmic | Memory grows logarithmically |
| **O(N log N)** | N log N | Memory grows as N × log N |
